  "name": "Smash Ⅱ",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Acquired with CR11 or higher. During this Main Process, you gain a +[SRx4] bonus to [Weapon Attack] damage rolls.</p>\n<p>(CR17): Increase the bonus to +[SRx5].<br>(CR23): Increase the bonus to +[SRx7].</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A skill that raises the power of subsequent attacks by swinging the weapon around. Accumulated experience turns a mere preliminary movement into a deadly strategy.</p>",
